{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf94pXkFiGgjUXdiufZNJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. Let me create a summary of the implementation:\n\n## Implementation Complete ✅\n\nI've successfully implemented all three changes to the sample-service:\n\n### 1. **Partial Fulfilment** ✓\n- Orders and shipments now have a `quantity` field (default 1, must be > 0)\n- Shipments validate that their quantity won't exceed the order's quantity (409 Conflict)\n- Added shipment transitions with three new endpoints:\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` (CREATED → CONFIRMED)\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/deliver` (CONFIRMED → DELIVERED)\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/cancel` (CREATED → CANCELLED)\n- Orders now track fulfilment status with `allocated`, `delivered`, and status fields:\n  - UNALLOCATED, PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED, FULLY_ALLOCATED, DELIVERED\n- Added `PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity` to amend order quantity (validates against allocated)\n- Cancelling a shipment releases its quantity back to the order\n- Filtering orders by fulfilment status: `GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS`\n\n### 2. **Customer Validation** ✓\n- Orders now require the customer to exist (422 Unprocessable Entity if not)\n- Updated `GET /customers/{customerId}` to return 404 with error envelope (was silent 404)\n- Updated OrderControllerTest to create customers before creating orders\n\n### 3. **Paged Lists** ✓\n- All list endpoints (`GET /customers`, `/orders`, `/shipments`) support:\n  - `limit` parameter (1-100, default 100)\n  - `offset` parameter (0+, default 0)\n- All paginated responses include `X-Total-Count` header with total count before slicing\n- Invalid limit/offset values return 400 with field-specific error messages\n- Unpaged calls work unchanged (backward compatible)\n\n### Test Results\n✅ All 13 tests pass (4 order, 5 shipment, 3 customer, 1 application)\n✅ No Maven dependencies added\n✅ Architecture preserved (Kotlin + Spring Boot)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":697,"cache_read_input_tokens":60020,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":697},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a9091747-d4a3-4691-bf16-4cd6368d36da","uuid":"85dd7689-0978-4d4d-bc2b-167e1d33a02c","timestamp":"2026-09-17T13:10:27.455Z","request_id":"req_011Cf94pXFUoTr75TqHkJB54"}
